# Docker build context (plan 2026-10-27-docker, 01-design-spec.md §2 and §9). Mirrors
# .gitignore: of data/, only the committed README.md and vocab/ enter the context.
# Patterns are anchored at the context root; a leading **/ matches at any depth.
data/*
!data/README.md
!data/vocab/

.git
.venv
**/.venv
logs
**/__pycache__
.pytest_cache
**/.ipynb_checkpoints
**/*.part
**/.DS_Store
**/*:Zone.Identifier

# Local Claude Code state; the committed judge definition stays (tests/test_llm_recheck.py reads it).
.claude
!.claude/agents/a1-judge.md

# Secrets never enter the context or an image (01-design-spec.md §9).
.env
.streamlit/secrets.toml
compose.override.y*ml
